    <mxCell style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5f6b7a;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1" id="e0.text.4" value="&lt;i&gt;The project calls itself a developer preview that has not had a security audit.&lt;/i&gt;">
